
SPIKE: Hive Capability Analysis and Recommendation


Description
Investigate Hive Gateway, Hive Router and Hive Registry capabilities and determine whether Hive can support the long-term GraphQL federation architecture currently implemented through Grafbase.
The spike should validate Federation 2.0 compatibility, schema governance capabilities, licensing requirements and recommended production deployment patterns.
Acceptance Criteria 

	•  Document Hive Gateway capabilities
	•  Document Hive Router capabilities
	•  Confirm or reject Federation 2 support
	•  Identify Schema Registry integration path
	•  Complete enterprise capability assessment
	•  Produce recommendation
